：传说中马基·埃亚尔唯一的堕落印记——清除印记哦。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a2a9b96ee1897319548bf33228d6a71fbdd03466d9910c7256a12019ddbd3295","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f4695dd9f693b0c4b6cb2a4909b071479b533e46bcccbd2361c71d505fcc4c3","logical_entry_identity":"8c37795c40ccc2d86ddfe52c211828d3074f6f7a0cb0230c1c3efe781fc1fc10","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Reach out and touch the blood and health of your foes. Any creatures caught in the radius 2 ball will be unable to heal above their current life value (at the time of the casting) for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"掌控敌人的血液和肉体。在 2 码范围内，任何被鲜血禁锢攻击到的敌人的治疗或回复将不能超过当前生命值，持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3ccdd82ebe21563ef259d4635f41dd87a9ad17e9b4f0b60275d7b34af9b7c2bc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f49b2f48cc5a1882efeb790a736f3acc08523fca2c8a41bb146e149ef16c8d7","logical_entry_identity":"842aa1752e8ba745b5a066e39242f71dd591167b61f0603b64d7c1b7b01f43e9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"alchemist emerald","source_tag":"alchemist gem","target":"炼金祖母绿"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e05dd783f0257787ed6709bdb8a503d2bfcc0f2e0abdaa1f98591eb5fda7ca63","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f4ae394eecf39123cc1ef7e090638e9180cda42467f464f794e558c2503bc0b","logical_entry_identity":"997ccb0330996d9f744c7e3bf0f623ea8dc5dbbd49526c24ebd6ebeaafc1159d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s empowers %s %s!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s充能了%s%s！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"41b5d71ae89ac07baec7bac81026874e230fb670e0650b3b2dc45272089acb7e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8f50862c9c049f72849f3ccff5c6d9caec0a81f6615bc8dce08d1f9c5399e8a2","logical_entry_identity":"60bf83080ba8abd6a26e8b5f946974d96176ba8a8b5fb7104f8a529356ebd95d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%sWave clear!","source_tag":"log","target":"%s波次已全清！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dbb8de6a1f5c6979d2365bef9b9f3a7a03ebf0d6aa903ace35dd90926e9fddd6","c